            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "McEmmy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These were edible and my girls certainly enjoyed them, but I found these to be more cake than brownie. I thinking the baking powder needs to be reduced so it doesn’t puff up like a cake. I’d also reduce the cooking time so it was more fudgey - I pulled mine out 5 minutes early and it was still over done. I might try this again but I will doctor it some if I do.",
